{"id":"f744fc361db0ee96","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md","title":"按共同后果比较真理理论","display":"df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories — 按共同后果比较真理理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories","aliases":["91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories","91-df-truth-theory-hierarchy"],"display":"df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories — 按共同后果比较真理理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-compositional-truth]]","[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-VF]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories</span><span>91-df-truth-theory-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories — 按共同后果比较真理理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"66b3ab8406681395\" href=\"?note=66b3ab8406681395\" title=\"91-df-compositional-truth\">91-df-compositional-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories-—-按共同后果比较真理理论-$\\mathcal-H_{\\mathcal-C}$\">df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories — 按共同后果比较真理理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak T\">\\(\\mathfrak T\\)</span> (待比较的理论类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> (共同语言中的公式类)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\\mid\\mathcal T\\vdash\\varphi\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\\mid\\mathcal T\\vdash\\varphi\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_1\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_1)\n\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_2),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_1\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_1)\n\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_2),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}of\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theories}\\vdash\n\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}\n\\coloneqq\n(\\mathfrak T,\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}of\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theories}\\vdash\n\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}\n\\coloneqq\n(\\mathfrak T,\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>比较必须固定理论版本与后果类。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 取算术句，并采用本目录\n所校准的标准版本，可概括为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{TB}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{UTB}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{FS}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{KF}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{VF}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PA}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{TB}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{UTB}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{FS}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{KF}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{VF}\n\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里 TB 是类型化逐句去引号理论；UTB 使用单个谓词，但统一双条件仍\n只以基础语言公式为矩阵；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 是无扩展语言归纳的组合\n理论；FS、KF、VF 是不同的无类型公理化。句法上的“有/无类型”并不\n决定保守性。</p>\n<p>FS 在算术上对应所有有限分层真理，但按 McGee 定理是\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致的；KF 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 以下的分层真理；\nVF 则达到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> 的强度。因此不能把 FS、KF、VF 写成等强，\n也不能用可靠性评价替代算术后果比较。</p>\n<p>算术后果包含、相对可解释性、保守性与证明论序数是不同关系。\n上面的链只陈述所标版本的算术校准，不自动给出任意语言中的逐句可证性\n等价或保留证明的互译。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories-—-按共同后果比较真理理论-$\\mathcal-H_{\\mathcal-C}$","text":"df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories — 按共同后果比较真理理论 $\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-compositional-truth","status":"resolved","id":"66b3ab8406681395","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-VF]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\\mid\\mathcal T\\vdash\\varphi\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_1\\preceq_{\\mathcal C}\\mathcal T_2\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_1)\n\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal T_2),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}of\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theories}\\vdash\n\\mathcal H_{\\mathcal C}\n\\coloneqq\